lib/puppet/type/sysctl.rb               augeasproviders_sysctl 4.1.0
lib/puppet/provider/sysctl/augeas.rb    augeasproviders_sysctl 4.1.0

Do not edit: TestAugeasFixturesMatchManifests (internal/units) requires each
file's sha256 to equal the digest in ../manifest.go. The unit's route also lists
augeasproviders_core's three files; they are in that unit's testdata/lib.

augeas/traces/ holds the sysctl cases (01*): every libaugeas call openvox 8.33.0
made to libaugeas 1.15.0 while applying the case's catalog, recorded by an
LD_PRELOAD interposer (see tests/spine/augeas/trace/). Do not edit: the provider's
call sequences are asserted equal to them. Re-record a case instead.
